#: includes/Admin/HelpContent.php:326
msgid "Do I have to add an action to every form?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/HelpContent.php:326
msgid "No. By default every form notifies. Under Settings, General you can choose selected forms only."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/HelpContent.php:327
msgid "Why is my group not in the list of chats?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/HelpContent.php:327
msgid "A bot only knows chats it heard from. Add it to the group and send /id there."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/HelpContent.php:328
msgid "Why does a button not appear?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/HelpContent.php:328
msgid "Messengers reject links to local or private addresses, and the mini app needs HTTPS. Such buttons are left out so the message still arrives."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/HelpContent.php:329
msgid "Where are tokens stored?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/HelpContent.php:329
msgid "Encrypted in the database with a key made from the salts of the site. If the salts change, enter the tokens again."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/HelpContent.php:330
msgid "What happens when I delete the plugin?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/HelpContent.php:330
msgid "Nothing is lost unless you switched on deletion under Settings, Privacy and data."
